<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 222 ALL OUT -- SECOND DAY, 2ND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 222 ALL OUT -- SECOND DAY, 2ND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, replying to the West Indies' first innings score of 147, were all out for 222 on the second day of the second test at Arnos Vale on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 147 (C.Hooper 81, R.Pushpakumara 5-41); Sri Lanka 222 (S.Jayasuriya 90; C.Hooper 5-26).</p>
